  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Collection And Analysis Of Data On The Pastoral Economy In Burkina Faso, Mali, Mauritania, Niger</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To this date, data has been collected in the four target countries (Mali, Burkina Faso, Niger and Mauritania) with around 1000 households being surveyed in each country. Draft reports at country level have been elaborated and restitution workshop have been held with stakeholders. It is now necessary to consolidate the results at the regional level, elaborate policy briefs for Niger and Mauritania, share the results at a regional level and produce a data paper.</narrative>
  </description>
